+    from the evidence baseline, because both of those vanish in exactly the
+    case this exists to catch: rewriting test_command invalidates the ancestor
+    evidence (the recorded command must match the current one), which drops the
+    baseline to the root, and a deleted report is otherwise indistinguishable
+    from first-time setup.
