  1224	+   a stub that prints the pass marker and `check` would run it — the change
  1225	+   would be signing its own evidence. So `check` refuses: a policy path that
  1226	+   resolves inside the repo under review (including via a symlink), a policy
  1227	+   file that is group- or world-writable, and a `.coverloop/config.json` that
  1228	+   defines `reviewers`/`reviewer_commands` at all.
