  1231	+   trusted file is not enough on its own — `python3 -m reviewer` would pick up a
  1232	+   planted `reviewer.py`, and `sh <scripts/reviewer` hides the path in a
  1233	+   redirect token, so no token check can cover shell semantics. `check` runs
